[{"client_msg_id":"ea9760b0-086d-4bc9-8052-4d58f7e48cf2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そこつらいですよね、なのでそこは素直に例外投げたりしたくなるのわかるなー(それが合う合わない処理あるけど)","ts":"1628406819.237300","thread_ts":"1628406363.230600","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CxxD"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"DA811520-466D-4474-A38B-BB24EC7FDE3D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、型から考えるのは若干ハイコンテキストな気がしますね。答えがだいぶ見えてないと書けないきがする。できれば最初はもっとシンプルに考えたい。\n要はバリデーションを例に考えたときに、例外となる値がやってきたときの型を最初から考慮して型書けるの？みたいな。","ts":"1628406363.230600","thread_ts":"1628406363.230600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K3V"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"8e296087-9134-4566-b791-5b6c0d53aa19","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"せっかく書いたテストコードも書き直し...","ts":"1628406589.236400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kwNQG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4aeb41af-3e71-499e-87b2-ad41b229f745","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"インターフェースうまく決められなくて右往左往してしまう","ts":"1628406563.235400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"THF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"261d1669-8597-481c-842e-faf701ad4a5b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「疎であること」「インターフェースの適切な設計」「データ型の適切な設計」これらすべて同質のものなんだろうなという考察","ts":"1628406559.235300","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1628406598.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iN0e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e029779-4081-4933-8cd5-e72e139e48a2","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"中になにがはいるかは、作るものがわかってれば埋めれるし、そうじゃないならそこはまだ曖昧みたいな","ts":"1628406543.234400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KJHCY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2947b33-585e-4fcc-8463-240aacfe18d1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"最初のころの型は、「ここではこのあたりの情報を出して受けるよね」くらいのざっくりで、あとから拡充される、というのはよくあるかなと思う\nというか特定のIF A-Bの受け渡しはここだけ、なので型AB、って決めるくらいなだけな気もw","ts":"1628406517.233800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C/G"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1D631ABC-52EF-499E-8FCB-76DE6401D25E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"はい、関数のI/Fを整理してテストコード化するのがテスト駆動なんですよね。","ts":"1628406468.232800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gjo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0664a05c-0a0f-4b9d-a910-f9b688489bd4","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"型というかインターフェースを整えるって考え方のがふさわしいかもしれない\nそう考えるとテスト駆動とやってることそんな変わらないかもしれない","ts":"1628406411.231200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YdS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DA811520-466D-4474-A38B-BB24EC7FDE3D","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"でも、型から考えるのは若干ハイコンテキストな気がしますね。答えがだいぶ見えてないと書けないきがする。できれば最初はもっとシンプルに考えたい。\n要はバリデーションを例に考えたときに、例外となる値がやってきたときの型を最初から考慮して型書けるの？みたいな。","ts":"1628406363.230600","thread_ts":"1628406363.230600","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K3V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"71982450-3978-4fce-8453-484d0ea30e1a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、実行時より前に検知できるのはたすかる","ts":"1628406333.229600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xGs5F"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8c83576-e8ed-498c-8de3-56b78842161a","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"型魔術が使われてるコード、ちょろっと修正したら今度は型が合わなくなって延々と苦労することもある","ts":"1628406303.229100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3DM8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4398BCB9-E829-4DD7-A65F-8A24A31D850B","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ガタガタ言わずに型を書け！開発","ts":"1628406139.226000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rRf3l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5295ff64-610e-47b0-87a7-3b041f9291e2","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"型駆動開発","ts":"1628405867.225100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kIKJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e52ba8f9-a121-4326-b829-65959b4f7037","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"とりあえず型を書いて実装を埋めるのなんかテスト駆動の一種ですよね","ts":"1628405824.224800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+/2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"60EA7D2A-701B-4203-818A-E30895E4C8CA","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"方向性が間違っているというのはぜんぜんありますね。ただ、テストさえ書けば、確実に前に進めるみたいな。","ts":"1628405777.224400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=8Rr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fd55387-ede9-4ff0-9e25-8a901f68272c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、テスト粒度によるけどユニットより大きいフローレベルになると、考慮がたりてなかった、テストともども修正せんと、はありえるしね","ts":"1628405673.223100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cmN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"EA32CF90-76F2-4DF3-A55F-7D832CD00E67","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"これは加速度を求める問題だから式もm/s^2にならないとなって","ts":"1628405670.223000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U776661HA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GqeS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1be15d9e-5e87-449f-ae0d-ac4246fd3bdb","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"こういうIFで動かすぜ(テスト)-\u0026gt;あれ動かない実装だxN-\u0026gt;動いた、なので陰蔽されるっていうだけなときもありますけどね","ts":"1628405613.221500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XyL+5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8EC98C14-8551-43B1-8FB5-2F864FDA6E61","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"高校物理で、式を考えるより先に単位の次元から考えたりしてたので、そういうイメージ","ts":"1628405607.221400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0LK6l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6C87892F-4529-41F4-8FF1-A23C53AA6796","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"型考えるのいいですよね\n処理を書く以外の実装の択を持っておくのがよさそうですね","ts":"1628405580.220000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qvghh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B6D14CE5-C375-44F6-A31F-185AD410D758","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"こうすれば動くやろ→あれ？うまく動かない。思ってたのと違ったわ\n\nっていうフローが、テスト駆動開発だと基本的には起こらなくなるんですよね。","ts":"1628405565.219400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WrsC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"51daa8cb-cc24-4ed1-af69-965b0ddc57ee","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"コード書いてる最中に色々書いて実験したりしてるからそれを残しておけばいいんだろうなぁ…","ts":"1628405563.219100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9Wj5m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"449A7154-C4FA-4FDB-AE01-22E1F9EAB838","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"実装方法が分からない難しいものでも、テスト駆動であれば書けるって言う一瞬のテクニックだったりしますからね。最初から実装方法が思い浮かぶ人からすれば必要なかったりします。","ts":"1628405433.215700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9hTg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06fa9dfe-4652-406e-9bac-dd4498e75061","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ完全に後からだとドリブンとはいえないので、開発中に「これダメかな?」みたいにREDになるテスト書いてそれを解消するとか、不具合修正とともに再現防止のテストを入れるとかかな?","ts":"1628405209.213200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RfuYK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4af6b57d-af1f-40b1-9718-9b49aff2c8a4","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"「テストドリブンはテストファーストである必要はない」ということらしいので、無理してテスト最初から書く必要もないですね (自分も後付で書いてる)","ts":"1628403715.212200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u/eU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a181c0b3-421a-4875-adde-370b0f4284af","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"型はほぼ最初から書くけどテストから書くの全然できない","ts":"1628399666.211100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4DwT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4bf95a11-ae45-479e-a809-c5c13bddb3af","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"おもしろかった。型駆動開発はイメージとしてTDDの設計を型注釈でやる感じっぽい","ts":"1628399232.210700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mbjYS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7be3a1e0-5bc8-49fc-b270-8d6d07d0a4ec","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://zenn.dev/kazuhe/articles/type-driven-development-typescript\u003e","ts":"1628399193.209800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Zenn: TypeScriptで型駆動開発","id":1,"title":"TypeScriptで型駆動開発","title_link":"https://zenn.dev/kazuhe/articles/type-driven-development-typescript","image_url":"https://res.cloudinary.com/zenn/image/upload/s--56npAWpa--/co_rgb:222%2Cg_south_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_37_bold:kazuhe%2Cx_203%2Cy_98/c_fit%2Cco_rgb:222%2Cg_north_west%2Cl_text:notosansjp-medium.otf_80_bold:TypeScript%25E3%2581%25A7%25E5%259E%258B%25E9%25A7%2586%25E5%258B%2595%25E9%2596%258B%25E7%2599%25BA%2Cw_1010%2Cx_90%2Cy_100/g_south_west%2Ch_90%2Cl_fetch:aHR0cHM6Ly9zdG9yYWdlLmdvb2dsZWFwaXMuY29tL3plbm4tdXNlci11cGxvYWQvYXZhdGFyL2ljb25fMGEwMmEwNWExZS5qcGVn%2Cr_max%2Cw_90%2Cx_87%2Cy_72/v1627274783/default/og-base_z4sxah.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"Zenn","service_icon":"https://zenn.dev/images/icon.png","from_url":"https://zenn.dev/kazuhe/articles/type-driven-development-typescript